[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l015","ordinal":104705,"en":"I pictured them too."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l016","ordinal":104706,"en":"With their mustaches bristling,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l017","ordinal":104707,"en":"The warrior corpses piled like mountains:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l018","ordinal":104708,"en":"Hey, I pictured that too."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l019","ordinal":104709,"en":"Infidel and Muslim:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l020","ordinal":104710,"en":"I pictured their clash."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l021","ordinal":104711,"en":"Fighting without retreat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l022","ordinal":104712,"en":"I pictured their battle."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l023","ordinal":104713,"en":"The two khans Baakybai and Duulat:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l024","ordinal":104714,"en":"I pictured those khans."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l025","ordinal":104715,"en":"Khan Alooke and Khan Azyz:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l026","ordinal":104716,"en":"I pictured those warriors."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l027","ordinal":104717,"en":"The horse I rode was Arbuudan;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l028","ordinal":104718,"en":"My own great dark figure—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l029","ordinal":104719,"en":"I pictured myself as well."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l030","ordinal":104720,"en":"Concerned with nothing else,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l031","ordinal":104721,"en":"You struggled for my breast;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l032","ordinal":104722,"en":"The dark blood running down my face"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l033","ordinal":104723,"en":"Poured down your temples:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l034","ordinal":104724,"en":"My foal, I pictured you too."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l035","ordinal":104725,"en":"'If he survives, my only one"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l036","ordinal":104726,"en":"Will come to this Talas,' I thought."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l037","ordinal":104727,"en":"'This white mausoleum standing here:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l038","ordinal":104728,"en":"If my foal enters within,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b003:l039","ordinal":104729,"en":"He will see what happened,' I thought."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l001","ordinal":104730,"en":"When you enter through the doorway,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l002","ordinal":104731,"en":"If you look to your left,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l003","ordinal":104732,"en":"Jerking on a golden lead rope,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l004","ordinal":104733,"en":"Struggling upon Algara,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l005","ordinal":104734,"en":"As though his wife were seized by a birth demon,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l006","ordinal":104735,"en":"As though pursuers were close behind,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l007","ordinal":104736,"en":"As though his wife had borne a son,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l008","ordinal":104737,"en":"The frenzied warrior Kalcha:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l009","ordinal":104738,"en":"I set him astride Alkara"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l010","ordinal":104739,"en":"And pictured him too."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l011","ordinal":104740,"en":"Great boots stretch out upon his feet;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l012","ordinal":104741,"en":"His neck cranes like a rooster's."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l013","ordinal":104742,"en":"His spectacles gleam;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l014","ordinal":104743,"en":"When you look at Konurbai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l015","ordinal":104744,"en":"A coral stone the size of a leather flask"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l016","ordinal":104745,"en":"Hey, flashes upon his crown."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l017","ordinal":104746,"en":"A lacquered pipe with a golden stem;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l018","ordinal":104747,"en":"Kalcha as great as a shelter:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l019","ordinal":104748,"en":"A warrior skilled among spearmen,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l020","ordinal":104749,"en":"An outstanding hero who knows the enemy's ways."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l022","ordinal":104750,"en":"Look carefully and you will see:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l023","ordinal":104751,"en":"His bristling mustache,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l024","ordinal":104752,"en":"Like the handle of a greased axe;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l025","ordinal":104753,"en":"His dangling nose,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l026","ordinal":104754,"en":"Like the sheath of a long straight sword;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l027","ordinal":104755,"en":"The corners of his two eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l028","ordinal":104756,"en":"Like an open grave;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l029","ordinal":104757,"en":"The space between his brows,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l030","ordinal":104758,"en":"Like a rich man's broad summer pasture."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l031","ordinal":104759,"en":"Konurbai, who speared your father Manas:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l032","ordinal":104760,"en":"He is that lion sustained by Shai;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l033","ordinal":104761,"en":"He is that warrior who knows the enemy's ways."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l034","ordinal":104762,"en":"The black horse beneath him—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l035","ordinal":104763,"en":"I wonder whether his black horse"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l036","ordinal":104764,"en":"Has wings upon its flanks."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l037","ordinal":104765,"en":"Whenever it may be, Konurbai:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l038","ordinal":104766,"en":"Let twelve worlds come against him together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0366:b004:l039","ordinal":104767,"en":"He is used to grinding them like roasted grain."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l001","ordinal":104768,"en":"If you look in front,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l002","ordinal":104769,"en":"Coral hat finials, precious coral stones:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l003","ordinal":104770,"en":"Among Konurbai's army"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l004","ordinal":104771,"en":"Is the khan of Luntun too."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l005","ordinal":104772,"en":"I pictured them as well:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l006","ordinal":104773,"en":"Khan Zholoi, khan of the lamas;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l007","ordinal":104774,"en":"Orokkyr, khan of the Shibe;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l008","ordinal":104775,"en":"Muzkindik, khan of the Solon;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l009","ordinal":104776,"en":"Ezkara, khan of the Manchu;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l010","ordinal":104777,"en":"Konurbai, the greatest of them all."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l011","ordinal":104778,"en":"Setting them all in an equal row,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l012","ordinal":104779,"en":"I pictured them together."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l013","ordinal":104780,"en":"If you look to your right,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l014","ordinal":104781,"en":"When he faces forward,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l015","ordinal":104782,"en":"He has the look of a lion;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l016","ordinal":104783,"en":"When he turns his back,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l017","ordinal":104784,"en":"He has the dread majesty of six thousand warriors."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l018","ordinal":104785,"en":"Taking the shape of a night terror,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l019","ordinal":104786,"en":"With eyes like a hungry lion's,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l020","ordinal":104787,"en":"With a face like buttered wheat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l021","ordinal":104788,"en":"With eyes like dusky mist,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l022","ordinal":104789,"en":"His eyes as broad as a lake basin,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l023","ordinal":104790,"en":"As though to swallow all he sees,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l024","ordinal":104791,"en":"Of middling height and broad shoulders:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l025","ordinal":104792,"en":"I dressed him in Akolpok,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l026","ordinal":104793,"en":"I mounted him on Akkula,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l027","ordinal":104794,"en":"Driving back the swarming Chinese,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l028","ordinal":104795,"en":"Making them flee stiff with fear,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l029","ordinal":104796,"en":"Sending them all toward Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l031","ordinal":104797,"en":"I pictured your father."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l032","ordinal":104798,"en":"Akkula beneath him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l034","ordinal":104799,"en":"The foal of a young mare,","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l035","ordinal":104800,"en":"The Duldul of the horse herds:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l036","ordinal":104801,"en":"'Your father's Akkula—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l037","ordinal":104802,"en":"Let the orphan see him clearly,' I thought,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l038","ordinal":104803,"en":"And pictured him too."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b003:l039","ordinal":104804,"en":"On this side of him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l001","ordinal":104805,"en":"Tall and broad-shouldered,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l002","ordinal":104806,"en":"Both a champion and a lion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l003","ordinal":104807,"en":"As great as half a mountain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l004","ordinal":104808,"en":"As though to devour whoever appeared,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l005","ordinal":104809,"en":"With a white face without freckles,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l006","ordinal":104810,"en":"With sheep-brown eyes, no pale eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l007","ordinal":104811,"en":"Wearing yellow leather trousers,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l008","ordinal":104812,"en":"Riding a horse such as Sarala,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l009","ordinal":104813,"en":"Carrying a spear without a tuft,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l010","ordinal":104814,"en":"A naked sword strapped at his side:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l011","ordinal":104815,"en":"Almambet, son of Khan Azyz,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l012","ordinal":104816,"en":"Was your father's sworn brother;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l013","ordinal":104817,"en":"I pictured him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l014","ordinal":104818,"en":"Girding his accomplished warrior's waist,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l015","ordinal":104819,"en":"If seven great dark hosts came,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l016","ordinal":104820,"en":"He would plunge in with his coat loose and attack."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l017","ordinal":104821,"en":"On this side of him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l018","ordinal":104822,"en":"With black felt edging on his hat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l019","ordinal":104823,"en":"Your own kinsman,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l020","ordinal":104824,"en":"Khan Manas's Syrgak:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l021","ordinal":104825,"en":"Never resting upon his elbow,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l022","ordinal":104826,"en":"Never sleeping so much as a wink,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l023","ordinal":104827,"en":"Light upon a horse, suited to a colt,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l024","ordinal":104828,"en":"Sleepless, watchful on the road,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l025","ordinal":104829,"en":"Bringing good fortune when sent ahead,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l026","ordinal":104830,"en":"Worth a great host when driving foes:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l027","ordinal":104831,"en":"Riding a strong, enduring steed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l028","ordinal":104832,"en":"Wearing a coat blue as iron,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l029","ordinal":104833,"en":"Strewing the unbelievers dead,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l030","ordinal":104834,"en":"The dark Kalmaks and Chinese,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l031","ordinal":104835,"en":"Driving them stiff with fear:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l032","ordinal":104836,"en":"I pictured Syrgak."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l033","ordinal":104837,"en":"On this side of him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l034","ordinal":104838,"en":"Riding a horse such as Kokala,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l035","ordinal":104839,"en":"Wearing a blue ribbed-cloth coat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l036","ordinal":104840,"en":"With shrill cries and fierce battle shouts,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l037","ordinal":104841,"en":"Beyond the whole world's strength to wrestle down,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l038","ordinal":104842,"en":"Beyond a lion's teeth to pierce,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0367:b004:l039","ordinal":104843,"en":"Who had received a letter from the caliph,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l001","ordinal":104844,"en":"Who was also called a mighty conqueror,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l002","ordinal":104845,"en":"Riding a horse no shot could catch,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l003","ordinal":104846,"en":"Wearing a coat no shot could pierce,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l004","ordinal":104847,"en":"His banner fluttering in his hand,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l005","ordinal":104848,"en":"The dark keen steel that drinks blood"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l006","ordinal":104849,"en":"Flashing at his wrist,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l007","ordinal":104850,"en":"His apple-like neck stretching out,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l008","ordinal":104851,"en":"His eyes reddening like a lion's,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l009","ordinal":104852,"en":"Girded with gold and rubies,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l010","ordinal":104853,"en":"Sullen, without a smile,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l012","ordinal":104854,"en":"Roaring, attacking alone:","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l013","ordinal":104855,"en":"Chubak, your father's sworn brother,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l014","ordinal":104856,"en":"I pictured him too."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l015","ordinal":104857,"en":"On this side of him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l016","ordinal":104858,"en":"Wearing a gray lynx-fur hat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l017","ordinal":104859,"en":"Brandishing a mottled blue shield,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l018","ordinal":104860,"en":"Attentive to reasoned words,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l019","ordinal":104861,"en":"His mouth rinsed with honey,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l021","ordinal":104862,"en":"His feet resting upon a thousand gold pieces,","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l022","ordinal":104863,"en":"Finding words when taken unawares,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l023","ordinal":104864,"en":"Finding sight in darkness,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l024","ordinal":104865,"en":"Bringing good fortune when sent ahead,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l025","ordinal":104866,"en":"Worth a great host when riding behind:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l026","ordinal":104867,"en":"The mount beneath him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l027","ordinal":104868,"en":"Red-maned and gray-maned,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l028","ordinal":104869,"en":"Never tires when ridden scouting,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l029","ordinal":104870,"en":"Never sickens when ridden to the rear."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l030","ordinal":104871,"en":"Khan Bakai's Kok Tulpar:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l031","ordinal":104872,"en":"Riding a horse such as Kok Tulpar,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l032","ordinal":104873,"en":"His eyes shining like the morning star,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l033","ordinal":104874,"en":"His golden crescent gleaming through a haze:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l034","ordinal":104875,"en":"When your father went to Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l035","ordinal":104876,"en":"The red banner of the Muslims"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l036","ordinal":104877,"en":"I placed in warrior Bakai's hand;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l037","ordinal":104878,"en":"The swarming infidels"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l038","ordinal":104879,"en":"I had him drive like dark willow branches;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b003:l039","ordinal":104880,"en":"Those who came before him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l001","ordinal":104881,"en":"I had your champion Khan Bakai strike down."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l002","ordinal":104882,"en":"Your father's sworn brother, the lion"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l003","ordinal":104883,"en":"Bakai, I pictured."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l004","ordinal":104884,"en":"If you look nearer this way,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l005","ordinal":104885,"en":"Broad-chested, with young-camel eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l006","ordinal":104886,"en":"With a majestic, spreading breast,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l007","ordinal":104887,"en":"Whetting his dark tongue,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l008","ordinal":104888,"en":"Singing forth before the khan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l009","ordinal":104889,"en":"Wearing seven different coats,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l010","ordinal":104890,"en":"Knowing the languages of seventy tribes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l011","ordinal":104891,"en":"With broad jaws and a broad tongue,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l012","ordinal":104892,"en":"His deep throat never faltering,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l013","ordinal":104893,"en":"Finding reasons, knowing words,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l014","ordinal":104894,"en":"A swift orator, skilled in fitting speech,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l015","ordinal":104895,"en":"With a gifted tongue beyond other men,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l016","ordinal":104896,"en":"With a morning-star forehead among men,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l017","ordinal":104897,"en":"The rival of fortunate warriors,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l018","ordinal":104898,"en":"Who had come to your leopard father Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l019","ordinal":104899,"en":"Through his good fortune:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l020","ordinal":104900,"en":"Azhybai, son of the Argyn,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l021","ordinal":104901,"en":"The interpreter of the world,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l022","ordinal":104902,"en":"Wearing a white ribbed-cloth coat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l023","ordinal":104903,"en":"Riding a horse such as Kartkuron."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l024","ordinal":104904,"en":"That brown horse of Azhybai's,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l025","ordinal":104905,"en":"When your father Manas was alive,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l026","ordinal":104906,"en":"Kartkuron, ridden on dispatches,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l027","ordinal":104907,"en":"Around the four corners of the world,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l028","ordinal":104908,"en":"To circle them four times and return:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l029","ordinal":104909,"en":"Kartkuron, ridden to carry news,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l030","ordinal":104910,"en":"Will not let you be taken in a shooting fight;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l031","ordinal":104911,"en":"Will not flag if you ride him into battle;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l032","ordinal":104912,"en":"Will not tire if you ride him scouting."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l033","ordinal":104913,"en":"Unless his lead rope is shortened to a handful,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l034","ordinal":104914,"en":"He will not yield to a determined foe;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l035","ordinal":104915,"en":"Unless true disaster strikes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l036","ordinal":104916,"en":"He will not let his rider fall to the foe."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l037","ordinal":104917,"en":"Father Kambar, numbered among the unseen:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l038","ordinal":104918,"en":"Kartkuron, whom he would ride into battle,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0368:b004:l039","ordinal":104919,"en":"When he truly lets out a neigh,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l001","ordinal":104920,"en":"No beast would turn its neck away before him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l002","ordinal":104921,"en":"The king of the horse herds:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l003","ordinal":104922,"en":"When they heard Kartkuron's voice,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l004","ordinal":104923,"en":"The mountain wild asses followed in a line."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l005","ordinal":104924,"en":"Your father, Khan Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l006","ordinal":104925,"en":"Would go to broad Beijing;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l007","ordinal":104926,"en":"Always he would set Kuron"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l008","ordinal":104927,"en":"Before the horses he had seized,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l009","ordinal":104928,"en":"To lead them onward."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l010","ordinal":104929,"en":"The rider upon his back,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l011","ordinal":104930,"en":"With a forked beard and a Sart's face,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l012","ordinal":104931,"en":"Azhybai, son of the Argyn khan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l013","ordinal":104932,"en":"Had quarreled with his father"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l014","ordinal":104933,"en":"And come to settle in Talas."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l015","ordinal":104934,"en":"Becoming your father's friend,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l016","ordinal":104935,"en":"He became a choro to Zhakyp's"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l017","ordinal":104936,"en":"Only son, Manas."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l019","ordinal":104937,"en":"With your fierce father, the lion,","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l020","ordinal":104938,"en":"He became a friend until Judgment Day."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l021","ordinal":104939,"en":"Taking keen dark steel,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l022","ordinal":104940,"en":"Furious and grim,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l023","ordinal":104941,"en":"I dressed him in shotproof armor,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l024","ordinal":104942,"en":"I mounted him upon Kartkuron;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l025","ordinal":104943,"en":"The Torgut, Chinese and Manchu,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l026","ordinal":104944,"en":"I set Azhybai upon them;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l027","ordinal":104945,"en":"Into the thick battle where blood flowed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l028","ordinal":104946,"en":"I sent him without drawing back;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l029","ordinal":104947,"en":"Upon the red-tufted Chinese,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l030","ordinal":104948,"en":"I sent him shouting war cries."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l031","ordinal":104949,"en":"He was your father's sworn brother:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l032","ordinal":104950,"en":"I pictured Azhybai."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l033","ordinal":104951,"en":"Khan Yraman's Yrchyuul,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l034","ordinal":104952,"en":"His trouser cord tasseled, with forty sections,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l035","ordinal":104953,"en":"Warrior Shuutu, with a hat like a yurt's roof felt,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l036","ordinal":104954,"en":"Akzholtoi's Tolgochu,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l037","ordinal":104955,"en":"Khan Shygai's darling,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b003:l038","ordinal":104956,"en":"Urumkhan's golden-crowned Muzburchak,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b005:l001","ordinal":104957,"en":"Kyrgylchal, leader of the forty,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b005:l002","ordinal":104958,"en":"Kyyalkhan's valiant one among spearmen,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b005:l003","ordinal":104959,"en":"Warrior Serek, who came from Lower Crimea,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0369:b005:l004","ordinal":104960,"en":"The fierce hero with far-seeing eyes:"}]
